    "description": "Toca Boca World: A Playground of Endless Fun, Creativity & Discovery!\r\n\r\nStep into Toca Boca World, a vibrant and dynamic universe where you can play, create and explore like never before! Whether you\u2019re designing your dream home, spending a day at the beach with friends, or running a unique pet daycare, the possibilities are endless.\r\n\r\nWhat will you explore first? Design your dream apartment, direct your own sitcom, or manage a bustling restaurant! The choice is yours in this expansive world where you can create your own stories, play with your characters and explore exciting new locations.\r\n\r\nWHY YOU'LL LOVE TOCA BOCA WORLD:\r\n\u2022Instant Fun \u2013 Download the app and start playing right away!\r\n\u2022Create Your Stories \u2013 Create, design and tell your own stories in your unique way.\r\n\u2022Home Designer \u2013 Use the Home Designer to create and decorate homes to your taste.\r\n\u2022Character Creator \u2013 Create custom characters with the Character Creator, giving them unique styles and personalities.\r\n\u2022Weekly Surprises \u2013 Explore weekly gifts every Friday to keep the fun going!\r\n\u2022Engage in Roleplay \u2013 Play out imaginative scenarios and roleplay adventures with your characters.\r\n\u2022Explore New Locations \u2013 Visit new places and play in a variety of fun-filled environments.\r\n\u2022Unlock Hidden Secrets \u2013 Explore and discover hundreds of secrets hidden throughout the world.\r\n\u2022Safe & Secure Play \u2013 Enjoy a protected environment for kids to explore, create and play freely.\r\n\r\nToca Boca World is the perfect game for those who want to explore, unleash their creativity, and express themselves. Whether you're designing characters or simply enjoying a quiet moment in your own world, it offers endless ways to play, relax and create.\r\n\r\nWEEKLY GIFTS TO EXPLORE:\r\nEvery Friday, discover surprise gifts at the Post Office. During our annual Gift Bonanza, explore re-released gifts from previous years!\r\n\r\nSTART WITH 11 LOCATIONS & 40+ CHARACTERS TO PLAY WITH:\r\nJump into Bop City and explore the hair salon, shopping mall, food court or your first apartment. Play your story with 40+ characters, create new scenarios and uncover hidden surprises along the way.\r\n\r\nCREATE & CUSTOMIZE YOUR WORLD:\r\nBoth the Home Designer and Character Creator tools are included in the download! Design and customize stunning interiors and create unique characters. The power to create is in your hands!\r\n\r\nEXPAND YOUR WORLD FOR MORE PLAY:\r\nReady for more? Explore the in-app shop with 100+ new locations, 500+ pets, and 600+ characters available for purchase, offering endless opportunities to create, play and explore even further. Add new houses, furniture and pets to expand your world!\r\n\r\nSAFE, CREATIVE, SINGLE-PLAYER FUN:\r\nToca Boca World provides a secure, single-player environment where kids can freely create, play and explore their imaginations.\r\n\r\nABOUT US: At Toca Boca, we believe in the power of play to inspire creativity. Our award-winning apps have been enjoyed by children in over 215 countries, with more than 849 million downloads worldwide. Visit tocaboca.com to learn more about our mission to empower kids to create, play and explore in a fun, safe environment.\r\n\r\nWe take privacy seriously. Learn more at tocaboca.com/privacy.\r\n\r\nDownload Toca Boca World for Free and Start Playing Today! In-app purchases available.",
